[I] A fast, multi-threaded malloc implementation

[T] TCMalloc is Google's customized implementation of C malloc() and C++
[T] operator new, a fast multi-threaded memory allocator using per-thread
[T] and per-CPU caches. This is the newer standalone TCMalloc rather than
[T] the version in gperftools.

[U] https://github.com/google/tcmalloc

[A] The TCMalloc Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

